==Alemannic German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|gsw|goh|masca}}, from {{inh|gsw|gem-pro|*maskwǭ}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|Masche}}, {{cog|nl|maas}}, {{cog|en|mesh}}, {{cog|sv|maska}}. Perhaps borrowed from another {{bor|gsw|gem|-}} language (such as {{w|Standard German}}), as expected inherited form is {{m|gsw||*Mäsche}}.

